  "description": "A single-storey rear extension at 535 Kenton Lane, Harrow. The extension will project approximately 6.0 metres beyond the rear wall of the existing dwelling within the back garden, and span 5.2 metres in width. The intent is for the extension to be used as a living room/bedroom, with ancillary accommodation including a bathroom and utility room. The proposed extension will feature a sloped roof design incorporating rooflights to allow daylight into the internal spaces. The height of sloped roof spans between approximately 3.0 and 3.2 metres above ground level. \nExternal materials will include beige brick walls and red tiled roof.\nNo changes are proposed to the first floor, and the works are confined to the rear of the property, with no impact on the front street elevation. The scale and design of the extension have been carefully considered to remain in keeping with the character of the existing dwelling and surrounding area.",
